## Upstream robot assets

### xArm / UF850 / Lite6 URDF and meshes

- **Upstream:** [xArm-Developer/xarm_ros2](https://github.com/xArm-Developer/xarm_ros2)
  (and related xArm ROS description packages historically used to generate
  standalone URDFs in this tree).
- **Typical upstream license:** BSD-3-Clause (see the upstream repository's
  `LICENSE` / package metadata; a full copy is not vendored here).
- **This repository's modifications include (non-exhaustive):**
  - Standalone URDF layouts and combo URDFs for Genesis (arm + end-effector).
  - Collision mesh packaging and visual GLB conversion / Draco compression.
  - Shared `visual_glb/` layouts and link-canonical gripper visuals.
  - Runtime manifests, overlays, and integrity budgets used by tests.

### End-effectors (Gripper G2, Bio Gripper G2, Vacuum Gripper, Lite6 Gripper, Lite6 Vacuum)

Visual and collision meshes for accessories follow the same upstream family
where noted in each `assets/urdf/<name>/README.md`. Combo URDFs, movable
visual variants, and compressed GLBs are maintained in this repository.

### Camera stand and depth cameras (`assets/urdf/{camera_stand,d405,d435,gemini_305,zed_x_nano}/`)

- **Camera stand:** UFACTORY CAD. GLB, STL and collision prisms are maintained in this repository.
- **Intel RealSense D405 / D435:** meshes from [realsenseai/realsense-ros](https://github.com/realsenseai/realsense-ros)
  (`realsense2_description/meshes`, Apache-2.0; full text in `assets/urdf/d405/LICENSE` and `assets/urdf/d435/LICENSE`).
  This repository converted them to Draco GLBs and added mount, hole and optical frames, box collisions and inertials.
- **Orbbec Gemini 305 / Stereolabs ZED X Nano:** meshes converted from the vendors' public CAD downloads (see each
  part's `README.md`). Product names are trademarks of their owners.

### Mounting base plates (`assets/urdf/{xarm_base_plate,uf850_base_plate,lite6_base_plate}/`)

- **Upstream:** Derived from publicly published UFACTORY mechanical STEP files and validated meshes in `ufactory_mujoco` (`*_base_plate`).
- **This repository's modifications:** Draco-compressed GLB visuals, prefixed convex collision prism STLs, uniform-density aluminium inertials, and runtime URDF packaging.

### SBS 96-well microplate (`assets/urdf/microplate/`)

- **Upstream:** [ramonaoptics/labware](https://github.com/ramonaoptics/labware/tree/b2de87e717584b2e27f436ee03c17b827085e87b) (`b2de87e`).
- **License:** BSD-3-Clause (`Copyright (c) 2026, Ramona Optics Inc.`; full text in `assets/urdf/microplate/LICENSE.txt`).
- **This repository's modifications:** Generated `sbs_96_well.glb`, `sbs_96_well_convex.stl`, and `sbs_96_well.urdf` from `SBS_96_well_plate.json` for Genesis contact simulation.

